  "scope": "Executed C17 choices admission, HTTP parser/control/projection and lifetime contracts with synthetic model frontiers. NOT-INFERENCE; no original-weight GPU numerical, quality or performance qualification.",
  "implementation": [
    "Additive lie_core_submit_choices_steering copies one optional immutable schedule into each child through the existing owner; old entry point, public layouts, seed offsets and rollback are preserved.",
    "Both HTTP creation routes accept dir_steering_plan with 1..64 ascending physical position/FFN/attention steps. Duplicate keys and malformed types/geometry are refused before client admission; protocol JSON does not enter the core.",
    "GET/POST /steering/{choice} selects one canonical zero-based stored child. Admission remains asynchronous, with independent tickets, confirmed policy/history and image/combined cache scopes.",
    "GET preserves declared schedule, completed/applied counts, attempted status, actual attempted positions and terminal unattempted outcomes after foreground retirement.",
    "Extra stored-choice references are charged before attachment only when a direction bank is present, then released on record disposal. No inference thread, Python product/default-test dependency, numerical-provider edit or DS4 tensor/framing change."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "Shared-core AR/MTP planned choices copy caller memory, refuse overflowing seed offsets and malformed plans, and reach declared prompt/decode frontiers independently.",
    "Both HTTP APIs exercise creation-time plans, exact positions, final scales/history, malformed/duplicate arrays and early-EOS unreached cancellation; Chat also exercises copied plans for two choices.",
    "Owned streaming Chat and Responses requests admit live changes; multi-choice Chat verifies selected-child confirmation and an unchanged peer with a different combined scope.",
    "Malformed/overflow/ambiguous choice indices refuse; finished jobs reject changes; DELETE retires stored control routes and releases retained children.",
    "Existing no-bank multi-choice retirement, OpenAI AR/MTP state, semantic HTTP, native multi-client/report/cache and host admission fixtures pass. Test children use a PATH without Python and private ephemeral loopback ports; GPUs masked.",
    "Final 24 Debug and 24 ASan/UBSan/LeakSanitizer CTest checks, 3 build-off checks and 32 C++ public headers pass. No assertion or sanitizer option is disabled."
  ],
